      "content": "hey so i jus got some dish soap in my eye while cleaning up. it feels kinda scratchy and its a bit red but i think im fine. i happen to have some old antibiotic eye drops in the cabinet from a few months ago for a different thing... do u think i should put some of those in now just so i dont get an infection or something?",
