      "content": "wow okay thats kinda scary. i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's expensive and i'm pretty sure it's just a tiny bit of soap. if i just rinse it with water for a few mins and then use the drops, wouldn't that be okay? i mean they aren't that old, maybe only like 4 months? they should still work to kill any bacteria from the soap right?",
